            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.0.3 — Hello, Pane</h3>
<ul>
<li>The browser has a name: Pane. You'll see it in the menu bar, Dock and app switcher.</li>
<li>Your tabs, spaces, history, bookmarks and settings carry over as they are.</li>
<li>Tip: rename the app in your Applications folder to “Pane” so Finder and Spotlight match.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
